flowchart LR
    R[Typed csdlc-edit request] --> C{Generation and digest current?}
    C -- no --> X[Fail closed; no mutation]
    C -- yes --> V[Verify canonical values and rendered cards]
    V --> P{Phase is implemented?}
    P -- no --> X
    P -- yes --> T{Review, publication, readiness truth absent?}
    T -- no --> X
    T -- yes --> Q{SIP + nonempty actor, reason, scope?}
    Q -- no --> X
    Q -- yes --> A[Record previous and new scope in audit operation]
    A --> M[Mutate SIP values AST]
    M --> N[Cross-card validate and render Markdown]
    N --> K[Atomic commit: cards, audit, generation, digest]
    K --> O[Typed validator proves canonical projections]

    REC[Typed csdlc-review recovery] --> I[Clean implemented state]
    I --> R

